&= 15+10i-3i^2
\end{align*}
Since $i^2=-1$, we have:
\begin{align*}
15+10i-3i^2 &= 15+10i-3(-1)\\
&= 15+10i+3\\
&= \boxed{18+10i}
\end{align*}The answer is: 18+10i

